{"In getClientsWithPermission, resourceStore.findByType(...) returns the resource-type resource named 'Clients' which gets added to the result set when admin has only 'all-clients' permission, causing callers to get an unusable entry and miss real client IDs - need to skip the resource-type resource and handle 'all-clients' permission separately": 0.9205429553985596, "Possible NPE when falling back to the 'all-clients' resource because getResourceTypeResource(...) can return null but the code immediately calls findByResource(server, resource) without a null check": 0.924802303314209}